{
  "case_id": "WALLET-VISION-26.1.2",
  "title": "星币钱包控件视觉取证（Sodium+Iris；生存物品栏；光影 关/开；含客户端探针自截图）",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "star-coin-wallet-gui"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：在 Sodium+Iris 环境、**生存模式物品栏**下取证「余额条 + 钱包按钮 + 星币/星币袋按钮」。上一轮发现在生存物品栏里**一个控件都没有**，而物品栏开着时原版不处理 F2 ⇒ 本轮另起客户端探针 astral_wallet_vision.js：落盘 mc.screen 真值/几何/guiScale（通道 kubejs_client），并用 Screenshot.grab 直接取 framebuffer（不受窗口合成与桌面遮挡影响）。整屏 window 抓取仍保留作对照。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set noon",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule advance_time false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "① 光影关闭（iris.properties 当前 enableShaders=false）：开生存物品栏，等探针自截图（+25 拍）后整屏取证。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "e"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "op": "screenshot",
      "tag": "wallet-shaders-off",
      "mode": "window"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "escape"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "② 开光影（iris 键位 k，需界面关闭时生效），等编译完成后重开物品栏取证。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "k"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "e"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "op": "screenshot",
      "tag": "wallet-shaders-on",
      "mode": "window"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "escape"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "收尾：把光影关回去（不污染后续用例与用户环境）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "k"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "crash"
    },
    {
      "type": "mixin"
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "wallet-shaders-off",
    "wallet-shaders-on"
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
